# hôm kia and ngày kia are a minimal pair pointing in OPPOSITE directions:
# both close on kia, and only the head noun -- hôm for the past family,
# ngày for the future one -- says which.  Matching on kia alone would put
# the answer four days wrong.
# en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/h%C3%B4m%20kia ("day before yesterday",
# with its own "not to be confused with ngày kia" note).
hôm kia
